# Connect Nuxt — local development

Copy to `.env` and fill secrets. Never commit real secrets.

```bash
# Auth.js
AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-32+-char-secret
NUXT_AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-32+-char-secret
AUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
NUXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/auth

# Microsoft Entra
AUTH_AZURE_AD_CLIENT_ID=
AUTH_AZURE_AD_TENANT_ID=
AUTH_AZURE_AD_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Hono connect-api (Sites/connect-api). Not Payload.
CONNECT_API=http://localhost:3003

# Optional: server-side connect-users JWT fallback (legacy env name still works)
# CONNECT_API_SERVER_BEARER=
# PAYLOAD_SERVER_BEARER=
```

Run connect-api on `:3003` before `npm run dev` here.
